# ENT Masters: Course Landing Page

A responsive landing page for the **1st Advanced Rhinoplasty Course** from the ENT Masters Fellowship Program, including a multi-step course application form.

**Live site:** https://ziadnafea.github.io/ent-masters-program/

## About the project

I started this project in **Figma**, where I designed the layout, visual hierarchy and sections of the page (hero, course format, faculty, who it is for, and the application flow).

I then built the page using **HTML, CSS and JavaScript**, based on my Figma design and my existing knowledge of HTML and CSS, with **AI assistance** to help me turn the design into working code. I used it as a coding assistant while keeping the design decisions and structure my own, and I am continuing to strengthen my front-end fundamentals.

## Built with

- Figma (UI design)
- HTML, CSS, JavaScript
- GitHub Pages (hosting)
- AI-assisted development

## Page sections

- Hero and call to action
- Course format (two-day program)
- Faculty
- Who the course is for
- What participants will experience
- Application and verification steps
- Multi-step application form

## Run locally

1. Clone the repository: `git clone https://github.com/ziadnafea/ent-masters-program.git`
2. Open `index.html` in your browser.

